OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into 74th Ian
OL,4,APaterson patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner investigating the deaths of
OL,7,Fformer patients of the jailed surgeon
OL,8,FIan Paterson has opened a 74th inquest.
OL,10,FOlive Corbett died aged 93 at a nursing
OL,11,Fhome in Solihull in 2006, after breast
OL,12,Fcancer spread to her lungs. Her family
OL,13,Fhas not yet been traced by the inquest
OL,14,Fteam.
OL,16,FJudge Richard Foster is examining the
OL,17,Fdeaths of some of Paterson's former
OL,18,Fpatients to determine whether or not
OL,19,Fthey died an unnatural death as a
OL,20,Fresult of his care and treatment.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
