OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into 74th Ian
OL,4,APaterson patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaterson was jailed for 20 years in
OL,7,F2017 for 17 charges of wounding with
OL,8,Fintent and three of unlawful wounding,
OL,9,Ffor carrying out botched and
OL,10,Funnecessary operations.
